From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:59:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/50] avutil/hwcontext_v4l2request: use cached CAPTURE
 buffers when supported

Mapping decoded frames for CPU access, e.g. hwdownload for a software
deinterlacer, reads from uncached memory and caps 1080i MPEG-2 on
Amlogic GXM at 35 fps.

When the CAPTURE queue supports cache hints, allocate the buffers with
V4L2_MEMORY_FLAG_NON_COHERENT and queue them with
V4L2_BUF_FLAG_NO_CACHE_CLEAN and V4L2_BUF_FLAG_NO_CACHE_INVALIDATE.
The decoder never needs the CPU caches, and the existing
DMA_BUF_IOCTL_SYNC around the hwmap does the maintenance only for
frames the CPU reads, so frames that only go to the display get none.

The kernel must sync non-coherent vb2 dma-contig buffers in the dma-buf
CPU access callbacks, or mapped frames show stale cache lines.

On VIM2 (GXM):

  1080i MPEG-2 decode + hwdownload: 35 fps -> 90 fps
  576i MPEG-2 decode + hwdownload:  165 fps -> 342 fps
  decode-only 1080i/576i/4K HEVC:   unchanged
  300-frame checksums:              identical

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
---
 libavcodec/v4l2_request.c         | 5 +++++
 libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavcodec/v4l2_request.c b/libavcodec/v4l2_request.c
index 81ad4d48f1..4ac56d78f5 100644
--- a/libavcodec/v4l2_request.c
+++ b/libavcodec/v4l2_request.c
@@ -162,6 +162,11 @@ static int v4l2_request_queue_capture_buffer(V4L2RequestContext *ctx,
         .type = ctx->fctxi->capture.format.type,
         .memory = V4L2_MEMORY_MMAP,
     };
+
+    if (ctx->fctxi->capture.capabilities & V4L2_BUF_CAP_SUPPORTS_MMAP_CACHE_HINTS)
+        buffer.flags = V4L2_BUF_FLAG_NO_CACHE_CLEAN |
+                       V4L2_BUF_FLAG_NO_CACHE_INVALIDATE;
+
     return v4l2_request_queue_buffer(ctx, &buffer);
 }
 
diff --git a/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c b/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c
index 067316ccaf..b3a0998314 100644
--- a/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c
+++ b/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c
@@ -855,6 +855,10 @@ static AVBufferRef *v4l2request_v4l2_buffer_alloc(AVHWFramesContext *hwfc,
     buffer = (struct v4l2_buffer *)ref->data;
     buffer->type = format->type;
 
+    if (format == &fctxi->capture.format &&
+        (fctxi->capture.capabilities & V4L2_BUF_CAP_SUPPORTS_MMAP_CACHE_HINTS))
+        buffers.flags = V4L2_MEMORY_FLAG_NON_COHERENT;
+
     if (num_planes) {
         buffer->length = num_planes;
         buffer->m.planes = (struct v4l2_plane *)(buffer + 1);
